@0    = ~Thank you. I shall endeavor to do my best while in your group.~
@1    = ~Well, well what do we have here?~
@2    = ~Have you decided to let me join your party? There is much evil in the world to destroy.~
@3    = ~I don't need your help at the moment.~
@4    = ~We would love to have you in our party, Nina.~
@5    = ~Improve your manner and I shall think upon joining you later.~
@6    = ~By the Blessed Mystra may evil hide before us!~
@7    = ~I can not travel with you any longer! I am leaving and if we cross paths again it will be the end of you!~ [cmni03]
@8    = ~That is unfortunate. In case you change your mind where do you want to meet up again?~
@9    = ~Go to the Copper Coronet. We will meet you there if we need your services again.~
@10   = ~Wait right here. We'll come back later if we need your help.~
@11   = ~I don't know. If you can, try and wait at a major tavern or inn.~
@12   = ~Would you like me to travel with you again?~ [cmni26]
@13   = ~Yes, Nina. Don't go anywhere.~
@14   = ~No, I think you should go.~
